Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.31,JP,,0,0,0,,美味しいサンドイッチの贈り物です。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.31,VI,,0,0,0,,Đây là món quà bánh mì kẹp ngon lành.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.91,JP,,0,0,0,,どうぞ召し上がれ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.31,0:00:08.91,VI,,0,0,0,,Mời bạn ăn nhé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.03,0:00:10.53,JP,,0,0,0,,ありがとう。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.03,0:00:10.53,VI,,0,0,0,,Cảm ơn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.27,JP,,0,0,0,,いただきます。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.27,VI,,0,0,0,,Xin phép ăn ạ.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.43,JP,,0,0,0,,ああ、もうダメだ。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.71,0:00:18.43,VI,,0,0,0,,Ôi, hết chịu nổi rồi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.52,JP,,0,0,0,,大丈夫ですか？
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.52,VI,,0,0,0,,Bạn có sao không?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.82,JP,,0,0,0,,僕は育ち盛りの狼ちゃん。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.28,0:00:26.82,VI,,0,0,0,,Tớ là chó sói con đang tuổi lớn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.54,JP,,0,0,0,,美味しそうなの、見っけ！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.74,0:00:32.54,VI,,0,0,0,,Thấy đồ ngon rồi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.68,JP,,0,0,0,,いただきます！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.68,0:00:34.68,VI,,0,0,0,,Ăn đây!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.88,JP,,0,0,0,,ガブッ！ガブッ！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.68,0:00:36.88,VI,,0,0,0,,Ngoạm! Ngoạm!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.06,0:00:44.98,JP,,0,0,0,,美味しかった！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.06,0:00:44.98,VI,,0,0,0,,Ngon quá!
